  Book your tickets now. \n*Members do not require a reservation.\n*Even
 ts and dates are subject to change. \nTIMES:\n\n11am– Happy Birthday 
 \n\n\n11:15 – Dance Party \n\n\n11:30pm – 12pm – Cake Distribution
